jj.liao@mediatek.com&gt; Signed-off-by: Matthias Brugger &lt;matthias.bgg@gmail.com&gt; (cherry picked from commit 41b3e0f067c26dd17837aa49fba13fcb5c6319e1  https://github.com/mbgg/linux-mediatek v4.3-next/for-next) Signed-off-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt;  BUG=chrome-os-partner:42720 TEST=Include CL:294028, CL:294029: no more crashes with this patch.  Change-Id: I54ebf035585e64190305af9be9f23f34ada05575 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/302280 Commit-Ready: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Nicolas Boichat &lt;drinkcat@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="302280" owner_email="jamesjj.liao@mediatek.com" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/third_party/kernel" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/kernel" ref="refs/changes/80/302280/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="chromeos-3.18" change_id="I3dfd3fd4b2e05ebe293d984b3d76f0099a11ca2c" commit="d693cf032943974febae0ea206ace957f93b83ad" commit_message="UPSTREAM: ARM: mediatek: enable gpt6 on boot up to make arch timer working  We enable GTP6 which ungates the arch timer clock. In the future this should be done in the bootloader.  Signed-off-by: Matthias Brugger &lt;matthias.bgg@gmail.com&gt; Signed-off-by: Yingjoe Chen &lt;yingjoe.chen@mediatek.com&gt; (cherry picked from commit 9821e545c5e02ac28af7c595ce71d037a1f74dc9  https://github.com/mbgg/linux-mediatek v4.3-next/for-next) Signed-off-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt;  BUG=chrome-os-partner:38746 TEST=build and boot oak-rev2  Change-Id: I3dfd3fd4b2e05ebe293d984b3d76f0099a11ca2c Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/305615 Commit-Ready: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Nicolas Boichat &lt;drinkcat@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="305615" owner_email=